    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2128/12 - 2019 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.06.18\n\nNo. 2128/12 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 18, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice Under Section 07 My No.: ATU/LAND/04/DO/41. Land Ministry's No. : 4-3/2016/HA/89. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 of the land Acquisition Act 28 of 1964, the Government intends to acquire following land/servitude* which is require for a public purpose: Description of the land Servitude to be acquired:\n\nThe allotment of land described below depicted in supplementary plan no. 37 of F.V.P. No. 86 prepared by Surveyor General situated at Thalahagama Village Divisional secretary's division of Athuraliya in the Gangabada Paththu North District of Matara. 1. Lot No. 807 Name of the land: Parana Pansal Waththa; Particulars of the land: Garden, Permanent Building; Claimant: Rev. Kirama Bodhirathana Chief Incumbent, Sri\n\nDharmarakshitha Puranaviharaya, Agalakada; Extent: 0.0181 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing to appear before me at Athuraliya Divisional Secretary's on the 05th day of August 2019 at 1.00 p.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 25th day of July 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nNIROSHA S. GAMAGE, Divisional Secretary, Athuraliya.\n\nDivisional Secretariat of Athuraliya, 12th June 2019. 07 - 35\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30306 - 23 (2019/06)"
